  (no_connect (at 513.97 107.62) (uuid bf07c684-bba6-4d5d-a308-745ae4963709))
  (text "1. ВХОД (5-22 V соларен панел, SS54 срещу обърнат поляритет) -> MPPT ЗАРЯДНО BQ25798 (1S, 750 kHz, 2.2 uH)" (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 65e439ee-88b1-4a8a-9f9e-6f0ca4b49ced))
  (text "SS54 = OR на двата входа + защита от обратна полярност. D3 (SMBJ24A) пази VBUS до 25 V." (at 20 174 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 75c06b16-6a1c-4943-880b-eaff37259433))
  (text "~CE: R4 към 3V3M = без заряд, докато MSPM0 не го свали (PA17). BQ25798 е на собствена I2C шина (SCL_I/SDA_I) към MSPM0. TP2 (QON) към GND = wake." (at 20 177.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 514bdf34-8f68-402a-bd43-1657c93a289e))
  (text "2. СИСТЕМНО ЗАХРАНВАНЕ (SYS -> LM66100 -> XIAO 5V) + XIAO nRF52840 & Wio-SX1262 + I2C" (at 225 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ca1f526c-5fad-456d-90bd-14c89bf62ca4))
  (text "3. БАТЕРИЯ 1S (Li-ion / LiFePO4): Ship FET (Q2 + JP3) -> J4 -> BMS (DW01A + HJ8205) -> шунт RS1 20 mOhm -> GND" (at 20 188 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e9171c76-e0b2-493e-bdb2-07fcccbf689a))
  (text "Q2 (AO3400A): S към BAT, D към батерията; в shutdown спира разреждането. За LiFePO4: затвори JP3 (без Q2)." (at 20 252 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a0867ab7-1d64-417a-b308-880dae801e1f))
  (text "BMS (DW01A + HJ8205) в минуса на батерията (BATT- -> BATT_S -> RS1 -> GND): защита от презареждане (4.3V), преразреждане (2.4V) и късо." (at 20 255.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 22d3e49b-a50b-4f2d-9533-0f072980260c))
  (text "LiFePO4: прагът 4.3V на DW01A е над 3.65V, т.е. от презареждане пази само VREG=3.6V на BQ25798; DW01A остава за 2.4V и късо/свръхток (~3A)." (at 20 259 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 025c7140-612f-4262-87e1-b17504743428))
  (text "4. MSPM0L1306: BQ25798 (I2C1), INA260 0x41 + 0x42 (I2C0)" (at 430 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid cd6a8f2a-1c91-44b3-9589-73e0260544fd))
  (text "SWD отдолу, колона 2.54 (отгоре надолу): TP12 3V3M, TP15 NRST, TP11 SWDIO, TP14 SWCLK, TP13 GND." (at 430 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c3994ab1-634d-45d9-b5d6-c0a8ed833cb9))
  (text "I2C0 (PA10/PA11) = шината на Xiao: INA260 0x41 + 0x42. I2C1 (PA16/PA15) -> BQ25798." (at 430 173.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9381b160-7d4e-4141-84c0-3b8842ed9bb3))
  (text "~CE PA17, нагревател PA26, CHEM PA23, VBAT PA24/A3, шунт PA25/PA18 (OPA0/OPA1)." (at 430 177 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 85a9f050-6b58-4f4e-8406-fab8869c2693))
  (text "5. НАГРЕВАТЕЛ J6: SYS -> Q4 AO3400A, PWM от MSPM0 (PA26)" (at 430 260 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f3ce8027-ab3f-45fa-95a6-51d030d72bae))
  (text "Студена батерия: MSPM0 спира заряда, BQ25798 продължава MPPT към SYS," (at 430 312 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d59f72bc-f1a6-4928-bd4d-efc8c639afeb))
  (text "нагревателят взима излишъка от панела. MSPM0 намалява PWM, щом през" (at 430 315.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 30b5cc1e-2df5-4b2b-b6b2-f3932a631833))
  (text "шунта RS1 потече разряд. Рестарт / без MSPM0: R28 държи Q4 изключен." (at 430 319 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 50e04641-6976-4a8e-b9ea-6a7d79307644))
